3{x}^{2}y-{y}^{3}+4y-x{y}^{2}+C" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421421 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421421 1083 #uuid "8d8717c4-00ef-5595-aeca-97e8db51eb3e" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421422 1080 "f(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y-{y}^{3}+4y+C" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421422 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421422 1083 #uuid "c86c75a8-56c7-544d-9bc9-6d9a38de128c" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421418 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421419 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421420 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421421 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421422 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1077 "selection" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1078 #edb/ref 17592186421418 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421423 1079 #uuid "23f524e3-bd79-5da0-98c3-54cfe15b71e1" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1068 #edb/ref 17592186421423 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1069 "q-81738" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1071 "Find $f(x,y)$ such that $∇f(x,y)=F(x,y),$ where $F(x,y)=(3{x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\text{ }i+(4-2xy)\\text{ }j.$" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1072 #uuid "49bf02f5-63a7-5afa-b61f-cb52dc9f8048" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421424 1074 "The gradient of the function $f(x,y)$ is defined as\n\n$$\n∇f(x,y)=\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\,i+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\,j.\n$$\n\nSince $∇f(x,y)=F(x,y),$ the function $f(x,y)$ must satisfy the following system:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=3{x}^{2}-{y}^{2},\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=4-2xy\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}$ with respect to $x.$ Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =\\int \\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (3{x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{3}-x{y}^{2}+g(y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, differentiating the above expression with respect to $y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=-2xy+{g}^{′}(y).\n$$\n\nTaking $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=4-2xy$ into account, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2xy+{g}^{′}(y) & =4-2xy \\\\ {g}^{′}(y) & =4 \\\\ g(y) & =4y+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant.\n\nFinally, substituting $g(y)=4y+C$ into our expression for $f(x,y),$ we get\n\n$$\nf(x,y)={x}^{3}-x{y}^{2}+4y+C.\n$$" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421425 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421427 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421425 1062 #uuid "15b0b7b5-261c-5133-9040-81b3cde4ef13" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421425 1063 #edb/ref 17592186266132 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421426 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421428 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421426 1062 #uuid "49bc2690-9ce7-5797-ab91-ca25964951a6" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421426 1063 #edb/ref 17592186421424 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421427 1062 #uuid "befa6245-a4cf-52d2-a6d8-3bd64bb32ca7" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421427 1063 #edb/ref 17592186266133 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421428 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421425 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421428 1062 #uuid "c075c9d7-1b99-540c-b91d-b2920031d6d9" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421428 1063 #edb/ref 17592186259727 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421429 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421426 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421429 1062 #uuid "db028f1e-0fa4-5096-9db0-6954db49115e" 13194139534431 17592186045417 true] [17592186421429 1063 #edb/ref 17592186351356